*.p8

# Claude Code worktrees. NOT ignored until 2026-08-29, which is how
# .claude/worktrees/determined-carson-439745 came to be committed as a GITLINK
# (mode 160000) around the build-265 era. Git reads that entry as a submodule,
# finds no .gitmodules record, and every `actions/checkout` on this repo dies:
#
#   fatal: No url found for submodule path '.claude/worktrees/…' in .gitmodules
#
# That is why the `pages-build-deployment` workflow has failed on every commit
# since at least 2026-08-19. Ignoring the directory stops it happening again; it
# deliberately does NOT untrack the existing gitlink (see the note below).
.claude/worktrees/
